      "signpost": null,
      "definition": "used as the object of a verb or preposition to refer to a woman, girl, or female animal already mentioned or clear from context",
      "explanation": "**Her** is the object form; the subject form is **she**. The same word, **her**, is also the possessive determiner before a noun (*her book*), a separate entry; the independent possessive, used without a following noun, is **hers**.",
